      },
      "description": "Enumerate a complete immutable snapshot, default limit 20, maximum 100. Cursor binds route/current generation and, for unread, readerScope. Invalid bindings return invalid_cursor; expired snapshots return conversation_cursor_expired. Unsupported must be an error, never an empty result."
    },
