        "$ref": "messages.schema.json#/$defs/ConversationListRequest"
      },
      "response": {
        "$ref": "messages.schema.json#/$defs/ConversationListResponse"
      },
      "description": "Without query/readerScope, preserve existing projectFilter/cursor/limit behavior. query requires its conversationListQuery capability; readerScope additionally requires conversation.unread.list capability and an authoritative read store. updatedAfter intersects projectFilter; ids requires projectFilter.kind=all. With readerScope, return authoritative Conversation.readState for every summary. Cursors bind route, query, projectFilter and readerScope; changing any is invalid_cursor."
    },
